  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "No.403: Change of Use from Flower Shop (Class E) to Hot Food Takeaway (Sui Generis); external alterations",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\nhot food takeaway is unacceptable in principle as it would result in an\r\nincreased hot food takeaway provision in too close proximity to the nearby Harrow\r\ncollege, contributing to childhood obesity within London, and forms part of an\r\nover concentration of hot food takeaways within the wider Harrow Centre. This\r\nresults in a use which would not be compatible with Policy E9 of The London\r\nPlan (2021) and the healthy places aspirations of the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
